+/* The surface: flat aFrameSurface (no gradient: the same colour at the top and the bottom), and one
+   row of aFrameDivider exactly (whole pixels, no anti-aliasing) at the bottom. */
+CPPUNIT_TEST_FIXTURE(RibbonCoatTest, testSurfaceIsFlatWithAWholePixelDivider)
